# Fixture drawings for the mark-craft instrument (plan 80-03).
#
# This directory exists so a craft fixture never has to be dropped into a walked
# directory to be measured. `lintDir` and `discoverChromeAssets` are both flat and
# non-recursive, and `markCraft.test.ts` demands a pinned row for every file it
# discovers under the Phase 79 candidates directory, so a fixture placed there would
# gain a pinned row and change the discovered input set.
#
# Plan 80-05 populates it with the retired geometry it needs as an anti-vacuity floor.
